                            </p>
                            <p style="font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.8;">Your payment is received and your locker allocation has been renewed. Your new period is shown below.</p>
                            <div style="margin:25px 0;border:1px solid #eee;border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;">
                                <table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14px;text-align:left;">
                                    <tbody>
                                        <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid #eee;">
                                            <td style="padding:12px 15px;color:#777;font-weight:500;width:40%;">Locker Allocation</td>
                                            <td style="padding:12px 15px;color:#333;font-weight:600;"><t t-out="object.name"/></td>
                                        </tr>
                                        <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid #eee;">
                                            <td style="padding:12px 15px;color:#777;font-weight:500;">Locker</td>
                                            <td style="padding:12px 15px;color:#333;font-weight:600;"><t t-out="object.locker_id.display_name"/></td>
                                        </tr>
                                        <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid #eee;">
                                            <td style="padding:12px 15px;color:#777;font-weight:500;">Start Date</td>
                                            <td style="padding:12px 15px;color:#333;font-weight:600;"><t t-out="object.start_date"/></td>
                                        </tr>
                                        <tr>
                                            <td style="padding:12px 15px;color:#777;font-weight:500;">End Date</td>
                                            <td style="padding:12px 15px;color:#333;font-weight:600;"><t t-out="object.end_date"/></td>
                                        </tr>
                                    </tbody>
                                </table>
                            </div>
                            <p style="font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:0;">
                                Please contact the locker administrator if you have any questions.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                        <div style="background:#f8f9fa;padding:20px;text-align:center;border-top:1px solid #eee;">
                            <p style="margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#999;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;">This is an automated email generated by Odoo.</p>
                            <p style="margin-top:6px;font-size:13px;color:#28a745;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:0;"><t t-out="object.company_id.name"/></p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </field>
        </record>

        <!-- Locker Expired -->
